    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/7a6e0fd76ff2694e1e9a2766de47106b.avif?t=1754001291\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your dream sushi restaurant in a wild and cheeky simulation like no other!</strong> \ud83c\udf63\ud83d\udc58</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Body Sushi</i>, a bold sushi restaurant simulator where your creativity, management skills, and a touch of mischief collide. Build, customize, and grow your sushi business\u2014but disaster strikes on opening day! \ud83d\udca5 Will you rise from the chaos or be served raw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 As the owner, you'll prepare perfect sushi, manage the restaurant flow, and meet colorful, quirky characters with wild personalities and their own demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf71 Huge variety of sushi styles to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/5f20e7516ee8a7706138716c2936e165.poster.avif?t=1754001291\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/5f20e7516ee8a7706138716c2936e165.webm?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/5f20e7516ee8a7706138716c2936e165.mp4?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc58 Customize and serve on your own <i>nyotaimori</i> (body sushi) plates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/c7e8a63b79ee400ed7b22cbc0d82cfda.poster.avif?t=1754001291\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/c7e8a63b79ee400ed7b22cbc0d82cfda.webm?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/c7e8a63b79ee400ed7b22cbc0d82cfda.mp4?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Recruit adorable waifus with unique skills and stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/7bd13d073923446b4988c77296ade330.poster.avif?t=1754001291\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/7bd13d073923446b4988c77296ade330.webm?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/7bd13d073923446b4988c77296ade330.mp4?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Funny, spicy, and unforgettable gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/cf7c17439e7488eea748306a6ebd6bdd.poster.avif?t=1754001291\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/cf7c17439e7488eea748306a6ebd6bdd.webm?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/cf7c17439e7488eea748306a6ebd6bdd.mp4?t=1754001291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 More exciting features coming soon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Add to your Steam Wishlist</strong> to follow our dev log and be the first to know about updates!</p>",
